# Dynamic homogeneous array mutation

Measures constant-index arithmetic and replacement in an unannotated dynamic
array whose elements remain integers for 5,000,000 iterations.

>>> checkpoint array-benchmark-introduction 73b9eaca434ae8064ec528bf039df87bf5d57dfd
Starting point: this commit introduced the benchmark runner and the first
array workloads, giving later array changes a historical comparison.

>>> source
let values = [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]
for (iteration in 0..5000000) {
    values[0] = values[0] + 1
}
print(values[0])
